# Base URL of our Sports API. Required by src/services/api.ts — the app
# throws explicitly at startup if this is missing, rather than silently
# falling back to a wrong address.
#
# When testing with Expo Go on a physical device, "localhost" resolves to the
# phone itself, not the computer running the Sports API — use the LAN IP
# address of that computer instead (e.g. from `ipconfig` on Windows or
# `ifconfig` on macOS/Linux). Copy this file to .env and fill in your own.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://SEU_IP_LOCAL:3000
